    sentences:
    - 'Calendar for the park of Neohuskvarna 2134. '
    - '26th March:'
    - Ronny IV & Ragge VI from Neokalmar.
    - 50/250 tickets left.
    - '16th April:'
    - Cuirass from Neocardiff.
    - Sold out.
    - '14th May:'
    - "Monique Tremblay from Autre Qu\xE9bec."
    - Sold out.
    - '11th June:'
    - BBQ Patriots from Trump Power.
    - 249/250 tickets left.
    - '2nd July:'
    - Voyage from Pyongyang.
    - Sold out.
    - '9th July:'
    - The Zhongguo Family from Luoyang.
    - 250/250 tickets left
    - "The list goes on\u2026"
